# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Gate — .gitignore
#
# The Xcode project is GENERATED. `project.yml` is the source of truth; run
# `make project` after cloning. Never commit Gate.xcodeproj — see
# docs/05-architecture.md, "Project generation: XcodeGen".
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

## Generated Xcode project / workspace — regenerate with `make project`
*.xcodeproj
*.xcworkspace

## Local, per-developer signing overrides (TEAM_ID). Template lives at
## Config/Local.xcconfig.example — copy it, fill it in, never commit it.
Config/Local.xcconfig

## Swift Package Manager
.build/
.swiftpm/
Package.resolved
*.xcodeproj/project.xcworkspace/xcshareddata/swiftpm/

## Xcode build products and per-user state
DerivedData/
build/
*.xcuserstate
xcuserdata/
*.xcscmblueprint
*.xccheckout
*.moved-aside
*.hmap
*.ipa
*.dSYM.zip
*.dSYM

## Xcode / Instruments
*.xcodeproj/xcuserdata/
*.xcodeproj/project.xcworkspace/xcuserdata/
timeline.xctimeline
playground.xcworkspace
*.trace

## Provisioning / signing artifacts (never commit these)
*.mobileprovision
*.provisionprofile
*.p12
*.cer
*.certSigningRequest

